  --force                    Ignore the revision.
  --request-id               Reuse only to retry.
  <slug>                     Slug of the page to soft-delete, e.g. 'people/alice-example'. (required)
  --purge                    Hard-delete after coordinated artifact removal (no 72h recovery; status purged). Honored only for the trusted local CLI; remote/MCP callers get permission_denied (a non-boolean value is invalid_params) and keep the soft-delete path.
